---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import DonateButton from '../components/DonateButton.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Mission"
  description="Learn about Kidz 4 A Cure's mission to bring hope and joy to children affected by HIV/AIDS and under-resourced families through Operation: Holiday Cheer."
>

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-red-dark to-brand-red py-20 sm:py-24 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-brand-gold blur-3xl"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full px-4 py-2 mb-6">
        <Icon name="mdi:heart-outline" class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold-light" />
        <span class="text-sm text-white/90">Our Purpose</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl leading-tight mb-6">
        Our Mission
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-white/85 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Bringing hope, dignity, and the magic of the holidays to children who need it most.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission Statement -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-red/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
          <Icon name="mdi:heart" class="w-8 h-8 text-brand-red" />
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-neutral-900 mb-6">
          Hope Is a Gift Worth Giving
        </h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-neutral-700 space-y-5 text-left sm:text-center">
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            Kidz 4 A Cure is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization dedicated to bringing joy, dignity, and a sense of belonging to children affected by HIV/AIDS and families facing economic hardship in South Florida. We believe every child deserves to feel celebrated — especially during the holiday season.
          </p>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            Our work is personal. It was born from love and loss, and every gift we give carries that intention: to remind a child that they are not invisible, not forgotten, and deeply, genuinely valued.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 501(c)(3) Callout -->
      <div class="bg-brand-gold-pale border border-brand-gold/30 rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-start gap-4">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-gold/20 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
          <Icon name="mdi:check-decagram" class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-gold" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="font-display font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-1">Registered 501(c)(3) Nonprofit</div>
          <p class="text-neutral-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Kidz 4 A Cure is a fully incorporated 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization. All donations are tax-deductible to the extent permitted by law. We are based in Davie, Florida and serve families throughout the South Florida region.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Operation Holiday Cheer -->
  <section class="bg-brand-cream py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <SectionHeader
        title="Operation: Holiday Cheer"
        subtitle="Our flagship program — where personal wishes become reality."
      />

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-lg">
            Operation: Holiday Cheer is not a generic toy drive. It's not a box of random items handed to a stranger. It is a <strong class="text-neutral-900">deeply personal</strong> experience designed to communicate something powerful to every child who participates:
          </p>
          <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-brand-red pl-6 py-2">
            <p class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-brand-red italic">
              "Someone out there knows your name, knows what you love, and thought of you specifically."
            </p>
          </blockquote>
          <p>
            Each year, we collect wish lists from children affected by HIV/AIDS and families navigating economic hardship. Every child submits <strong class="text-neutral-900">two personal wishes</strong> — items that reflect their individual personality, passions, and hopes.
          </p>
          <p>
            Generous donors are then matched with a child and fulfill those exact wishes. But the experience doesn't stop there — each child also receives a <strong class="text-neutral-900">new holiday outfit</strong> and additional surprises on the day of the event.
          </p>
          <p>
            The result is a celebration that feels less like charity and more like family — because that's exactly what it is.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- How It Works Visual -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          {[
            {
              icon: 'mdi:pencil-outline',
              title: 'Personal Wishes',
              desc: 'Every child submits two specific, personal holiday wishes — things they truly want and will treasure.',
              color: 'bg-brand-red/10',
              iconColor: 'text-brand-red',
            },
            {
              icon: 'mdi:tshirt-crew-outline',
              title: 'A New Outfit',
              desc: 'Every participant receives a brand-new holiday outfit so they can feel their best on the big day.',
              color: 'bg-brand-gold/10',
              iconColor: 'text-brand-gold',
            },
            {
              icon: 'mdi:star-outline',
              title: 'Extra Surprises',
              desc: 'We love to go above and beyond — additional gifts and surprises make the day even more magical.',
              color: 'bg-brand-red/10',
              iconColor: 'text-brand-red',
            },
            {
              icon: 'mdi:hand-heart-outline',
              title: 'A Donor Who Cares',
              desc: 'Each child is matched with a real person who chose to sponsor them specifically — making the connection personal.',
              color: 'bg-brand-gold/10',
              iconColor: 'text-brand-gold',
            },
          ].map(item => (
            <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-5 flex items-start gap-4 shadow-sm">
              <div class={`w-10 h-10 ${item.color} rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0`}>
                <Icon name={item.icon} class={`w-5 h-5 ${item.iconColor}`} />
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-display font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-1">{item.title}</div>
                <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">{item.desc}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Not Generic Section -->
  <section class="bg-neutral-900 py-20 sm:py-24 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <Icon name="mdi:heart-multiple-outline" class="w-12 h-12 text-brand-gold-light mx-auto mb-6" />
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-6 leading-tight">
        This Is Not a Generic Donation
      </h2>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
        When you sponsor a child through Kidz 4 A Cure, you aren't writing a check to an abstract cause. You are fulfilling the specific, personal wish of a real child who has faced challenges no child should have to face. Your gift says: <em class="text-white">"I see you. I chose you. You matter."</em>
      </p>
      <p class="text-white/70 text-base leading-relaxed">
        That kind of intentional generosity changes something in a child. It builds a foundation of self-worth that no amount of hardship can easily shake. And that — more than any toy or outfit — is the true gift of Operation: Holiday Cheer.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <DonateButton href="/donate" label="Sponsor a Child Today" variant="gold" size="lg" />
        <DonateButton href="/about" label="Our Story" variant="outline" size="lg" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
